cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If these energies are used in published work, cite this package and the sources below."
title: "skempi-foldx: FoldX binding ddG for SKEMPI 2.0"
abstract: >-
  Precomputed FoldX interaction-energy changes for protein-protein binding mutations defined by
  SKEMPI 2.0, with the campaign pipeline that produced them. Twelve decomposed AnalyseComplex
  terms per mutation -- the total and eleven of its components -- as mutant minus wild-type,
  over 6003 records. Energy values are tied to a
  release: a mutation's ddG depends on the whole mutation list it was computed in.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Chin
    given-names: Connor
    email: cchin29@stanford.edu
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-01"
license: MIT AND CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/cchin29/skempi-foldx"
keywords:
  - FoldX
  - SKEMPI
  - protein-protein interaction
  - binding affinity
  - ddG
